  "title": "Chief Justice of India Upholds Judicial Oversight Over Public Figures and Infrastructure",
  "summary": "The Supreme Court dismissed a plea against Shah Rukh Khan’s Mannat renovation and a bungalow in Bhojshala, highlighting judicial oversight over public figures and infrastructure. The court also ruled against influencers Samay Raina and others for jokes related to the Delhi riots, emphasizing the importance of judicial oversight in addressing public grievances. The court’s decisions reflect ongoing efforts to ensure transparency and accountability in public governance.",
  "facts": [
